:1-53, 186-217` — Preserve triggers, hysteresis, LRU, rename-before-delete, and interlocks. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_snapshot/repo_snapshot.py:1-54` — Preserve faithful tree materialization, LFS/submodule limits, atomic publication, and fetch prerequisite. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_snapshot/__init__.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_snapshot/cache.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_snapshot/delta_tree.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_snapshot/gc_trigger.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_snapshot/git_fetch.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_snapshot/janitor.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},